{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/comments/6724902271","html_url":"https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1237#issuecomment-6724902271","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1237","id":6724902271,"node_id":"IC_kwDORhCjFc8AAAABkNXdfw","user":{"login":"realmarcin","id":4625870,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MjU4NzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4625870?u=4a54630ef210e4f76a452eea65cda1b56370734c&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin","html_url":"https://github.com/realmarcin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-11-08T17:47:04Z","updated_at":"2026-11-08T17:47:39Z","author_association":"MEMBER","body":"Confirmed source-application finding: the integration draft selected two explicitly blocked #758 phosphate fragments without their coupled membership transaction.\n\nThe immutable, unapplied-in-corrected-root draft `cdff9ef796b6c2ecf112218be61843fc1928f442ff4a7ddd89758ea116be8cb2` selects:\n\n- `ORIGINAL-w08::if-reject-monohydrate-on-dihydrate` on `Nah2po4_X_2_H2o.yaml` (selected payload `7e689de2587e2b477baeed67debae88fd7dec68108bb9d1c92ee752b84660f71`).\n- `if-add-mono-source-spelling` inside composite `TARGET-023` on `Sodium_phosphate_monobasic_monohydrate.yaml` (composite payload `8e38355154a74a9341845c3c280736ebc1ddc73413376a8631e083dd0cc21b59`).\n\nBoth authentic published worker08 proposal objects explicitly say BLOCKED AS ISOLATED APPLICATION until both alias changes, all six source-label overrides and three-form membership/count changes are reviewed together. Actual draft coverage contains no `Nah2po4.yaml` operation; the actual A842 consumer has none of the six required override keys. This is an integration-selection defect, distinct from valid individual chemical evidence and ordinary export/role holds. The earlier cancelled partial source root remains preserved and must never be resumed. Its failed journal records TARGET-023 among27 completed operations, and its monohydrate owner matches composite8e383551; the dihydrate operation was not completed and that owner remains at authentic a22b2a81. Corrected B2 retains both authentic baseline owners and has no source application.\n\nThe earlier #758 decision remains applicable. Current NCI/OLS evidence reconfirms NCIT:C66551 as the specific dihydrate term, but this was already known there and does not settle the coupled application condition. Do not perform an isolated exact-term promotion, predicate patch or partial alias transfer.\n\nBounded disposition for this campaign: defer BOTH worker08 fragments, retaining their original proposal objects, source-case hashes and scientific conclusions on #758. `TARGET-023` also contains a separate worker07 contribution: genuine original payload `b58cdefabd6bc38c3659b7ed5998bafd969d1dff8b240eb0a704555aa717715b` adds only the independently sourced M2237 name Sodium dihydrogen orthophosphate monohydrate. It contains none of the three transferred #758 spellings. That contribution may remain only through an explicit origin-aware selection and fresh exact-payload review; do not silently relabel the composite or drop worker08's case accounting.\n\nIndependent read-only assessment: `preflight/inherited-form-predicate-independent-assessment-v1/HANDOFF.json`, SHA256 `624a8c931b210cd73ef9dc013b43aea43413e71421d2958ef761806a29aafa0a` under `.temp/all-unmatched-20261107`. Complete actual proposal/coupling observation is retained with this comment's outbound evidence. The all1,022-origin source-application-precondition audit is in progress to distinguish any further explicit application conditions from ordinary scientific/export holds. No constructor, source plan, owner, canonical mapping or approval was changed to make this finding disappear.\n\nCorrection to the initial version of this comment: I incorrectly stated that neither phosphate owner was changed in the cancelled attempt. The actual failed journal and all four B/B2 owner hashes were then checked; TARGET-023 was completed there. The original outbound text and this correction evidence are both retained under `.temp/all-unmatched-20261107/preflight/phosphate758-cancelled-root-status-correction-v1/` and its preceding publication packet. No cancelled files were reset or reapplied.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/comments/6724902271/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"pin":null}